<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:53:08 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>澳大利亚的通货膨胀证明了澳大利亚央行的鹰派政策立场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes</link><description>澳大利亚10月份核心通胀意外加速，凸显了经济中持续存在的价格压力，并证实了储备银行官员的鹰派评论。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes'&gt;澳大利亚的通货膨胀证明了澳大利亚央行的鹰派政策立场&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia’s Hot Inflation Vindicates RBA’s Hawkish Policy Stance&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:32:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于交易商权衡供应增加的迹象与霍尔木兹海峡周围船只遭受的袭击升级，油价下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日元债券发行取消后乐天信用风险飙升</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/rakuten-credit-risk-surges-after-yen-bond-offering-scrapped</link><description>乐天集团 (Rakuten Group Inc.) 取消在债券市场筹集约 1500 亿日元（合 9.42 亿美元）的计划后，该公司的信用风险飙升至 2025 年 4 月以来的最高水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/rakuten-credit-risk-surges-after-yen-bond-offering-scrapped'&gt;日元债券发行取消后乐天信用风险飙升&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rakuten Credit Risk Surges After Yen Bond Offering Scrapped&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/rakuten-credit-risk-surges-after-yen-bond-offering-scrapped</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:23:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>印度反人工智能股票交易面临高估值和全球关税风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/india-s-anti-ai-stock-trade-confronts-rich-valuations-global-tariff-risks</link><description>与此同时，印度银行系统的现金紧缩迫使贷方以更高的成本借款。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/india-s-anti-ai-stock-trade-confronts-rich-valuations-global-tariff-risks'&gt;印度反人工智能股票交易面临高估值和全球关税风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：India’s Anti-AI Stock Trade Confronts Rich Valuations, Global Tariff Risks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/india-s-anti-ai-stock-trade-confronts-rich-valuations-global-tariff-risks</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:30:28 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>台湾股市暴跌 8%，黄仁勋的提振迅速消退</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8</link><description>随着投资者重新关注全球人工智能行业的担忧，亚洲股市对黄仁勋职业生涯复兴的热情在周三迅速消失。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8'&gt;台湾股市暴跌 8%，黄仁勋的提振迅速消退&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang Boost Fades Fast as Taiwan Stocks Tumble 8%&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/jensen-huang-boost-fades-fast-as-taiwan-stocks-tumble-8</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:45:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据说星巴克正在与银行合作出售日本业务</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/starbucks-is-said-to-engage-banks-for-sale-of-japan-business</link><description>据知情人士透露，星巴克公司已聘请顾问，准备以数十亿美元的价格出售其日本业务。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/starbucks-is-said-to-engage-banks-for-sale-of-japan-business'&gt;据说星巴克正在与银行合作出售日本业务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Starbucks Is Said to Engage Banks for Sale of Japan Business&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/starbucks-is-said-to-engage-banks-for-sale-of-japan-business</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:10:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本 40 年期债券发行需求低于 12 个月平均水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/japan-40-year-bond-sale-sees-weaker-demand-than-12-month-average-mwvkr2jb</link><description>由于财政不确定性打压了投资者的胃口，周三日本 40 年期政府债券拍卖吸引的需求低于 12 个月平均水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/japan-40-year-bond-sale-sees-weaker-demand-than-12-month-average-mwvkr2jb'&gt;日本 40 年期债券发行需求低于 12 个月平均水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan 40-Year Bond Sale Sees Weaker Demand Than 12-Month Average&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/japan-40-year-bond-sale-sees-weaker-demand-than-12-month-average-mwvkr2jb</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:39:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>由于对人工智能繁荣持久性的怀疑导致科技股撤退，股票遭到抛售，期货进一步走软。国债因避险需求而上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Losses Build as AI Trade Falters, Oil Drops: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>